<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of Davis Cup</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group three matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Turkey beat San Marino 3-0.</p>
<p>Baris Ergum beat Christian Rosti 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Erhan Oral beat Domenico Vicini 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Mustapha Azkara/Alaaddin Karagoz beat Gabriel Francini/Vicini</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Macedonia beat Ethiopia 2-1.</p>
<p>Results (Macedonian names first): Dragan Jovanovski lost to</p>
<p>Samuel Gebriel 6-2 4-6 0-6</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko beat Yohanes Setegne 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Lazar Magdincev/Sevcenko beat Gebriel/Habtamu Kidane 6-2  6-1</p>
<p>Macedonia beat Turkey 2-1.</p>
<p>Results (Macedonian names first): Magdincev lost to Karagoz</p>
<p>4-6 4-6</p>
<p>Sevcenko beat Ergum 6-4 6-0.</p>
<p>Magdincev/Sevcenko beat Oral/Azkara 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>San Marino beat Ethiopia 2-1.</p>
<p>Results (San Marino names first):</p>
<p>Christian Rosti beat Habtamu Kidane 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Domenico Vicini beat Samuel Gebriel 6-2 6-4.</p>
<p>Gabriel Francini/Maximulano Rosti lost to Habtamu</p>
<p>Kidane/Yohannes Setegne 3-6 6-7.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Senegal beat Bosnia 3-0</p>
<p>Jean Noel Said beat Haris Basalic 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Yahia Doumbia beat Merid Zahirovic 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Doumbia/Thierno Ly beat Basalic/Eldar Mustafic 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Luxembourg beat Armenia 3-0</p>
<p>Adria Graimprey beat Artak Harutyunyan 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Sacha Toma beat David Babayan 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Johnny Goudenbour/Pascal Schaul beat Harutyunyan/Anri Makichian</p>
<p>(Armenia) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Senegal beat Luxembourg 2-1.</p>
<p>Results (Senegal names first):</p>
<p>Said lost to Schaul 4-6 4-6</p>
<p>Doumbia beat Graimprey 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Doumbia/Thierno Ly beat Johnny Goudenbour/Sacha Thomas 7-6 6-2.</p>
<p>Bosnia beat Armenia 3-0</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic beat Artak Harutyunyan 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic beat David Babayan 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Mustafic/Zahirovic beat Haik Hakopian/Anri Makichian 6-4  6-2.</p>
</text>
